  m_text: You can only repair your ship in shop or by collecting credits. If you
    crash into a ship it will take half you hp, unless you only have one quarter
    - then it will instantly destroy you, so don't be afraid to crash your ship in
    a time of need. Try different build styles with upgrades. Make sure you have
    enough barrier hitpoints (basically allows enemies to pass to the bottom of your
    screen).  Some enemies drop randomized upgrades - they might upgrade or downgrade
    one of your stats, it's risky but sometimes worth it.
