  m_text: Aiming is a bit tricky. The ship's crosshair follows your cursor, although
    it follows a little bit slower. So it takes more time to shoot precise shots, 
    that's why you'll have to predict where the enemy will be. Don't also forget
    your ship's turn speed. All of these variables matter when aiming.
